        <text>Mostly clear, with a low around 63. Northwest wind around 5 mph becoming east after midnight. </text>
        <text>Sunny, with a high near 81. Light and variable wind becoming west 5 to 10 mph in the morning. Winds could gust as high as 20 mph. </text>
